# Supabase (PersonaAI)

- Auth: Supabase only (email + Google). No Clerk.
- DB: Supabase hosted Postgres — no local Postgres in docker-compose.
- Next.js: session via `@supabase/ssr`; protect `/onboarding/*` and `/app/*`.
- FastAPI: verify Supabase JWT (JWKS first, optional `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`); upsert `users` from `sub`.
- Frontend never queries `ai_profiles` with anon key — all CRUD via FastAPI.
- Never commit `.env` / `.env.local` or paste secrets into chat.
